                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"></polygon><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"></path></svg>
                  <span>Salida del sistema...</span>
